          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Services</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Integrative, whole-person care: consultations, herbal medicine, nutrition, mindfulness and events series.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --earth-1:#3b2f2f; /* deep soil */\\n      --earth-2:#7a5a4f; /* warm clay */\\n      --leaf:#8aa173; /* sage */\\n      --sun:#f4c27a; /* gentle gold */\\n      --muted:#6b6b6b;\\n      --bg:linear-gradient(180deg, #fffaf6 0%, #fff9f2 40%);\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      --maxw:980px;\\n      --accent:var(--leaf);\\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--earth-1);}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,250,0.85);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(59,47,47,0.08);position:relative;overflow:hidden}\\n    /* unique organic svg band */\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-10%;top:-15%;width:60%;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sun),var(--leaf));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{color:var(--earth-2);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a.primary{background:var(--leaf);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    h1{margin:6px 0 8px;font-size:28px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:0}\\n\\n    /* sections */\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:22px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),rgba(250,248,244,0.9));padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(122,90,79,0.06)}\\n    ul.services{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    li.service{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--leaf),#6e8a5f);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}\\n    h3{margin:0;font-size:18px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    .aside h4{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n    button.cta{background:var(--earth-2);color:white;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}\\n    a.ghost{border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.08);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--earth-2);text-decoration:none}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:22px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(122,90,79,0.08);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    small{color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media(max-width:900px){\\n      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .pattern{display:none}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 600\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f4c27a\\\"/>\\n          <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8aa173\\\"/>\\n        </linearGradient>\\n      </defs>\\n      <g transform=\\\"rotate(-18 300 300)\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\">\\n        <ellipse cx=\\\"300\\\" cy=\\\"300\\\" rx=\\\"320\\\" ry=\\\"120\\\" opacity=\\\"0.22\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"220\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" r=\\\"60\\\" opacity=\\\"0.16\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"380\\\" cy=\\\"420\\\" r=\\\"90\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A whole-person approach in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our Way</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-bottom:18px\\\">\\n        <h1>Services — studied, simple, seasonal</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We combine clinical insight with lifestyle guidance: tailored consultations, botanicals, nutrition, mindful practice and community gatherings. Learn, adapt, and steward your health—no quick promises, only steady care.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">What we offer</h2>\\n            <ul class=\\\"services\\\">\\n              <li class=\\\"service\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"icon\\\">C</div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <h3>Integrative Consultation</h3>\\n                  <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A comprehensive intake exploring history, environment and goals. Foundation for a sustainable plan.</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <li class=\\\"service\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"icon\\\">H</div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <h3>Herbal & Botanical Support</h3>\\n                  <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Evidence-informed herbs chosen in context—education on uses, precautions, and interactions.</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <li class=\\\"service\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"icon\\\">N</div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <h3>Nutrition and Lifestyle Counseling</h3>\\n                  <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Whole-food guidance, meal patterns, sleep and movement strategies aligned with your rhythm.</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <li class=\\\"service\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"icon\\\">M</div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <h3>Mindfulness & Stress Resilience</h3>\\n                  <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Practical practices to quiet the nervous system and restore balance—brief, doable, compassionate.</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n\\n              <li class=\\\"service\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"icon\\\">E</div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <h3>Events & Series</h3>\\n                  <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Workshops and group series for learning skills together—seasonal topics, community-focused.</div>\\n                </div>\\n              </li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Packages & timing</h2>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Sessions can be single visits or part of a curated series. Timelines are individualized—expect collaborative pacing, not rushed fixes.</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n              <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"ghost\\\">Schedule a visit</a>\\n              <button class=\\\"cta\\\" onclick=\\\"location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}'\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            </div>\\n          </section>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h4>Social proof</h4>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">\\\"Thoughtful, calm and practical care. I learned tools I still use daily.\\\" — client in {{CITY}}</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"height:10px\\\"></div>\\n            <h4>Quick benefits</h4>\\n            <ul class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;padding-left:16px\\\">\\n              <li>Personalized plans</li>\\n              <li>Education-first approach</li>\\n              <li>Mind–body integration</li>\\n            </ul>\\n            <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"ghost\\\">Questions?</a>\\n              <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">How a session flows</h2>\\n        <ol class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"padding-left:18px\\\">\\n          <li>Intake: listening to story and patterns.</li>\\n          <li>Plan: gentle, practical steps grounded in evidence and context.</li>\\n          <li>Follow-ups: adjust, measure, and support sustainable change.</li>\\n        </ol>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Questions we often hear</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">\\n          <strong>Do you prescribe herbs with pharmaceuticals?</strong> We educate about interactions and coordinate with your prescriber when needed.\\n          <div style=\\\"height:6px\\\"></div>\\n          <strong>Do you guarantee results?</strong> No. We offer education and partnership; outcomes depend on many factors.\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(138,161,115,0.06),rgba(244,194,122,0.04));\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Join a series</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Our events series are learning-focused—topics rotate with the seasons. Sign up to receive schedules and early-bird invitations.</p>\\n        <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n          <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.06)\\\" required>\\n          <button class=\\\"cta\\\">Join</button>\\n        </form>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <small>&copy; {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></small>\\n      <small>Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</small>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"conditions.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Common Concerns — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Typical health concerns we support: stress, sleep, digestion, inflammation, energy — educational guidance and whole-person care.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff8f3;--warm:#7a5a4f;--soft:#8aa173;--muted:#6b6b6b;--card:#fff;--radius:12px}\\n    html,body{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--warm)}\\n    .shell{max-width:940px;margin:30px auto;padding:26px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.92),rgba(255,250,246,0.95));border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(122,90,79,0.06);position:relative;overflow:hidden}\\n    .band{position:absolute;left:-8%;top:-6%;width:58%;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{font-weight:800}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--warm)}\\n    h1{margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:26px}\\n    .intro{color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid rgba(122,90,79,0.06)}\\n    .concern{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .dot{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--soft),#6e8a5f);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:20px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(122,90,79,0.06);padding-top:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.band{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"shell\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"band\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <radialGradient id=\\\"r1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f4c27a\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8aa173\\\"/></radialGradient>\\n      </defs>\\n      <path d=\\\"M0 100 C120 0, 240 200, 360 100 C480 0, 600 200, 720 100\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#r1)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"80\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\"/>\\n    </svg>\\n\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Care that listens: whole-person work in {{CITY}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Main</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our Way</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <h1>Common concerns we support</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"intro\\\">The list below describes frequent patterns people bring. Our role is educational and supportive: to help you understand possible contributors and craft manageable plans. We do not promise cures.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">S</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Stress & Anxiety</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Chronic stress shows as restlessness, muscle tension, disrupted appetite and focus. Interventions include pacing, breathwork, sleep hygiene and mindful practices.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">Z</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Sleep Disturbance</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Difficulty falling or staying asleep is common. We explore habits, light exposure, evening routines, and gentle botanical or behavioral strategies when appropriate.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">G</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Digestion & Gut Health</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Bloating, irregularity, or sensitivity often relate to diet, stress, or microbial balance. Education, dietary patterns and selective testing can clarify next steps.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">I</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Inflammation & Pain</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We address lifestyle, movement, and nutritional support to lower inflammatory drivers while coordinating with medical care for diagnostics and treatment where needed.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">E</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Low Energy / Fatigue</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Patterns of sleep, blood sugar, micronutrients, stress and activity all matter. Evaluation is educational and often reveals modest actionable steps.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <p class=\\\"disclaimer\\\">Disclaimer: This information is educational and not a substitute for personalized medical advice. If you have concerning or urgent symptoms, please seek immediate medical attention or consult your primary care provider. Treatments discussed may complement, not replace, medical care.</p>\\n          </section>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">What to expect</h4>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">An initial visit focuses on story and priorities. We co-create a plan that may include lifestyle change, resources for self-care, and optional testing if it will add clarity.</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n            <h4>Quick guide</h4>\\n            <ul class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"padding-left:18px\\\">\\n              <li>Education over prescriptions</li>\\n              <li>Coordination with your providers</li>\\n              <li>No guaranteed cures; steady support</li>\\n            </ul>\\n            <div style=\\\"height:10px\\\"></div>\\n            <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--soft);color:white;text-decoration:none\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">When extra testing helps</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Occasionally targeted labs (thyroid, inflammation markers, nutrient levels, stool testing) can clarify a diagnosis or guide choices. Labs are optional and discussed as an educational tool; we review results in context and coordinate with your care team.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <small class=\\\"muted\\\">Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></small>\\n      <small class=\\\"muted\\\">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</small>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Our Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"A calm, collaborative intake, individualized plan, and thoughtful follow-up. Optional lab education as part of whole-person care.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fffdf9;--tone:#6b4f46;--accent:#8aa173;--gold:#f4c27a;--muted:#6b6b6b}\\n    html,body{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tone)}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:32px auto;padding:26px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.95),rgba(255,250,246,0.96));border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(107,79,70,0.06);position:relative}\\n    .svg-back{position:absolute;right:-6%;bottom:-6%;width:44%;opacity:0.10;pointer-events:none}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--tone);text-decoration:none}\\n    h1{margin:10px 0 6px}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .step{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fffaf4);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(138,161,115,0.06)}\\n    .step h4{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .labs{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .labs .card{flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(138,161,115,0.04),rgba(244,194,122,0.02));border:1px solid rgba(122,90,79,0.04)}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:20px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(122,90,79,0.06);padding-top:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}\\n\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr}.labs{flex-direction:column}.svg-back{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"svg-back\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 600\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"gg1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8aa173\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f4c27a\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      </defs>\\n      <g fill=\\\"url(#gg1)\\\">\\n        <rect x=\\\"60\\\" y=\\\"380\\\" width=\\\"420\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" rx=\\\"80\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"480\\\" cy=\\\"120\\\" r=\\\"64\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n        <path d=\\\"M120 200 C200 80, 380 80, 460 200\\\" stroke-width=\\\"64\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gg1)\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" opacity=\\\"0.1\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A steady practice of listening in {{CITY}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Back</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Our Way</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <h1>How we work together</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">A clear, humane path: attentive intake, collaborative plan, and follow-ups that respect your pace. Labs may be useful sometimes; we present them as educational tools, not automatic prescriptions.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"timeline\\\" aria-label=\\\"process timeline\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <h4>1. Intake — we listen</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A full conversation about history, routines, stressors, and goals. We gather context before offering recommendations.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <h4>2. Assessment — clarity</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We synthesize patterns and identify modifiable factors. Testing is discussed only when it adds clear value.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <h4>3. Plan — small, doable steps</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Personalized strategies that fit your life: habits, nutrition, gentle herbs, and practices to build resilience.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <h4>4. Follow‑up — adapt</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Regular check-ins to adjust the plan. Health unfolds over time—we measure progress and iterate.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <h3>About optional labs</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"labs\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <strong>When labs help</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Targeted tests (e.g., thyroid function, nutrient levels, basic inflammation markers) can illuminate causes of fatigue, mood changes, or gut concerns. We discuss pros, cons and next steps.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <strong>How we use results</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Results are interpreted in context. Labs are tools for conversation—not a substitute for clinical judgment. We avoid unnecessary testing and focus on meaningful data.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Note: any lab orders are optional and coordinated with you and, when appropriate, your primary care provider.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(138,161,115,0.04),rgba(244,194,122,0.02));\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">A gentle invitation</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We aim to teach you the why behind each step. Whether you seek symptom relief, better sleep, calmer days, or a clearer relationship with food and stress—our role is guide and collaborator.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"height:8px\\\"></div>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none\\\">Begin a conversation</a>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">FAQ — about the process</h4>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">\\n          <strong>How long until I see change?</strong> Some people notice small shifts quickly; durable change often takes weeks to months depending on the concern.\\n          <div style=\\\"height:8px\\\"></div>\\n          <strong>Are herbs safe?</strong> Herbs can be supportive but are not risk-free. We discuss interactions and tailor choices carefully.\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <small class=\\\"muted\\\">Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></small>\\n      <small class=\\\"muted\\\">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</small>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
